seg-699c946d7d09 = A single scenario answers one question about one situation. A mission is a sequence of situations, and a design study is a family of them. The <c1/> scenario kind composes the existing kinds into one run without re-implementing any of them: every member is an ordinary scenario table carrying its own <c2/>, dispatched through <c3/> exactly as <c4/> would run it, and the campaign only reads numbers back out of the result documents.

# text
seg-cb4f48673970 = A campaign is <b>MODELLED</b>. Its composition identities are tested (below), but chaining phases is a modelling choice, and each phase is only as good as the kind that ran it.

# text
seg-80e367fbc391 = Run one like any other scenario:

