seg-c4443bf160f7 = <c1/> on a campaign writes each member scenario that has geometry as its own file set, the member's label inserted before the format suffix: every phase run (<c2/>, or <c3/> when the phase has several runs), the sweep's base scenario (<c4/>), the Monte Carlo scenario (<c5/>) and each composed member (its own label, with the shared values it binds written in). A member identical to an earlier one is written once; hand-offs and sweep or seed values applied at run time are not in the exported scenarios.

